                    <span>What questions should I ask before agreeing to a specific treatment?</span>
                  </summary>
                  <div class="mt-3 ml-7 space-y-3">
                    <p>Useful ones: What subtype and risk level is my BCC? Why this treatment over the others? What's its cure rate for a tumor like mine? What will the scar look like, and who does the repair? What are the risks and the recovery time? What happens if margins aren't clear? And how will we follow up? Our <a href="/basal-cell-carcinoma/treatment-options" class="text-teal hover:text-teal/80 hover:underline transition-colors">treatment options</a> page can prime the conversation.</p>
